# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.Windows version 10
call list() -> [WindowInfo]
call move(id: UInt32, x: Int32, y: Int32) throws(WindowError)
call resize(id: UInt32, width: UInt32, height: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call top(id: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call entries() -> [WindowEntry]
call hide(id: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call show(id: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call close(id: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call zoom(id: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call hidden() -> [UInt32]
event changed(windows: [WindowInfo])
call workspaces() -> [WorkspaceInfo]
call workspace(number: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call send(id: UInt32, number: UInt32) throws(WindowError)
call setMode(number: UInt32, mode: WorkspaceMode) throws(WindowError)
call act(verb: String) throws(WindowError)
```

# DESCRIPTION

The window list and its verbs (rio's wctl, typed).

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.Windows`, version 10, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

